stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> BaseMapLoad
    BaseMapLoad --> BaseProfile: metadata profileId exists
    BaseMapLoad --> Rejected: profileId missing or invalid
    BaseProfile --> BoardStreaming: GridBoard owns WorldGridLoadedChunks
    BoardStreaming --> BaseActive: binding.Current == SimulationRuntime service
    BaseActive --> BaseUnload
    BaseUnload --> Cleared: release policy and clear binding/service
    Cleared --> FormationMapLoad
    FormationMapLoad --> FormationProfile: extends mass_navigation
    FormationProfile --> FormationActive: new runtime and stable binding
    FormationActive --> [*]
    Rejected --> [*]
